      "created_at": "2015-02-28T16:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>C... I think... Eitherway, only one goes away and the other remains in play.</p><p>Each&nbsp;<span>Neutralizing Resonator has their own Start of Turn, so you'd do whichever one was in play first, destroying it if you also destroyed an Ongoing, then you would move to the second&nbsp;</span><span>Neutralizing Resonator.</span></p>",
